The '''Merced-Concepción Corridor''' ({{Langx|arn|Konarüpü|4=way of the warrior}}), more popularly known as '''''Mercepción''''', is an [[W:Megalopolis|megalopolis]] on the southern shore of the [[Strait of Ivorra]], which stretches from [[Merced]] to [[Concepción]], approximately {{convert|150|km|mi|0|abbr=on}}. Within the megalopolis, the majority of Cerdanya's economic output is generated, and cities within the corridor are among the most economically developed in [[Balisca|the confederation]]. It is the third most populous ''megalopoli'' in Balisca, after [[Concordia]] and [[Solana]]. It is included in the wider [[Gran País del Sur]] [[Megaregions of Balisca|megaregion]]. 

